# T22a: the T21 idle-start spot check (spot_idle_start.script) on the new grid (GDD §3.2, §8.1).
# Quick Race on Toy Town, steering assist on (pre-seeded settings.ron). The player does nothing at
# GO: it starts last now, so nobody can queue behind it (look-back at 2 s). From 3 s it drives
# throttle-only for 4 s — the assist puts it on the racing line — then brakes to a stop there, a
# stalled car on the line. The leaders lap it after ~25 s: they must steer round it, not queue.
wait ui
wait screen title
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # Title
wait screen main
0.3 nav keyboardA down             # Quick Race
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm
wait screen trackSelect
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # Toy Town (focused): select → Choose car
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # → Car select
wait screen carSelect
0.3 nav keyboardA confirm          # race
wait countdown
0.5 shot g_00_countdown
wait racing
@60 shot g_01_1s
@120 hold keyboardA lookBack 1
@150 shot g_02_2s_back
@160 hold keyboardA lookBack 0
@180 hold keyboardA throttle 1
@420 hold keyboardA throttle 0
@421 hold keyboardA brake 1
@460 hold keyboardA brake 0
@540 shot g_03_9s_stopped
@1500 hold keyboardA lookBack 1
@1560 shot g_04_26s_back
@1620 shot g_05_27s_back
@1680 shot g_06_28s_back
@1740 shot g_07_29s_back
@1800 shot g_08_30s_back
@1860 shot g_09_31s_back
@1920 shot g_10_32s_back
@1980 shot g_11_33s_back
@2040 shot g_12_34s_back
@2100 hold keyboardA lookBack 0
@2110 shot g_13_35s
@2400 shot g_14_40s
1.0 exit
